{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arthur's 1st Grade is the perfect combination of learning, fun, and helpful features. With 15 different educational activities and 20 creative activities, Arthur's 1st Grade teaches a full year's worth of first grade skills and entertains your child with limitless fun and learning!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Activity Center</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create storybooks and cards. Or, print games, crafts and more!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Measurement</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Help measure wrapping paper at the Sugar Bowl.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Progress Tracking</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete the learning activities to light up the characters and unlock rewards!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Kids Learn</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reading &amp; Vocabulary</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spelling</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sentence Construction</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arithmetic</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Matching &amp; Sorting</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Measurement</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Music Composition</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Story Writing</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arts &amp; Crafts</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Critical Thinking</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Categorization</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shapes &amp; Colors</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Special Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple Skill Levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Auto-Leveling</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progress Reports</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Personalization</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Automatic Help Messages</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Printable Activities</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4056560?t=1761296986","backgr